Phoebe CLI has been installed. Please note you may need to add to path if pb isnt working, or decide how to handle this on your own:
Needed Path: /usr/bin
For simplicity, one can run: export PATH=/usr/bin for bash/zsh
For fish: set -gx PATH /usr/bin
And source afterwards. source ~/.zshrc | source ~/.bashrc | source ~/.config/fish/config.fish
